flowchart LR
  subgraph BrowserBoundary[Browser and organisation trust boundary]
    User[Business user / approver]
    Web[DigitalInvoice React web app]
    User -->|Browser UI| Web
  end
  subgraph ApiBoundary[DigitalInvoice API boundary]
    API[PHP application API / role and tenant checks]
    ERPAPI[ERP read-only OAuth2 API]
    NRSAdapter[UBL adapter / local readiness]
    Queue[Local NRS staging queue / dry-run worker]
    Hooks[Outbound webhook outbox]
    API --> ERPAPI
    API --> NRSAdapter
    NRSAdapter --> Queue
    API --> Hooks
  end
  subgraph DataBoundary[Private data boundary]
    DB[(MySQL: organisation data, sessions, audit, queue)]
  end
  subgraph External[External service boundary]
    ERP[External ERP client]
    Receiver[ERP webhook receiver]
    Google[Google Sign-In]
    Paystack[Paystack]
    Email[Configured email provider]
    NRSSandbox[NRS MBS sandbox]
    NRSProd[NRS MBS production - licence gated]
  end
  Web -->|HTTPS / JWT cookies / CSRF| API
  ERP -->|HTTPS / OAuth2 client credentials / scoped bearer| ERPAPI
  API -->|Prepared SQL / tenant scoping / selected AES-256-GCM secrets| DB
  Hooks -->|HTTPS / HMAC-SHA256 / signed event| Receiver
  Google -->|Verified Google ID token| API
  Paystack <-->|HTTPS / verified provider webhook| API
  API -->|Configured mail transport| Email
  NRSAdapter -.->|Explicit sandbox HTTPS + API credentials| NRSSandbox
  Queue -.->|Not implemented: licence and review required| NRSProd
